 d Chinese\n  + Somali\n  + Spanish\n  + Swahili\n  + Tagalog\n  + Thai\n  
 + Traditional Chinese\n  + Turkish\n  + Ukrainian\n  + & will be closed We
 dnesday\, November 11\, 2026.\nRemoved:\n  - |\n  - |\n  - |\n  - & will b
 e closed Monday\, October 12\, 2026.\nhttps://www.maine.gov/sos/corporatio
 ns-commissions/uniform-commercial-code
